===Pronunciation===
*Hyphenation: ka·to
*Rhymes: [[Rhymes:Finnish:-ɑto|-ɑto]]
*{{IPA|lang=fi|[ˈkɑto]}}

===Etymology 1===
{{etystub}}

====Noun====
{{fi-noun|ka|type=mato}}

# [[failure]] of [[crop]]s
# [[loss]]

===Etymology 2===
Corruption of the verb [[katsoa]] (to look).

====Verb====
'''kato'''

# {{colloquial|lang=fi}} [[look]]!
#:Kato, tuolla on [[neekeri]]! &mdash; ''Look, there's a [[negro]]!''
# {{colloquial|lang=fi}} [[see]]
#:Kato, ei [[neekeri]] ole haukkumasana. &mdash; ''See, [[negro]] is not a pejorative word.''

====Interjection====
{{fi-int}}

# {{colloquial|lang=fi}} [[see]].
#:Se on kato sillä lailla. &mdash; ''See, that’s the way it is.''

